Z||000006||spideyfoot||06-11-2001||09:06 PM||||80s firebird wings fit. a plymith Sundance or something like that has a perfect fit wing looks like an IMSA wing. Some people use Mustang wings. That Mr2 wing a guy just posted looks pretty good too. Or a lot of people will argue that a GT looks a lot sleeker without a wing.||||reg||1
