Z||000011||stimpy||06-12-2001||09:55 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by fropuff:<BR><B>Hey there.  I'm looking to get a wing for my fastback GT, and was wondering what other options I have.<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Here's an option...DON'T DO IT!!!<BR>GT's do look a lot better with flat decks, in my opinion. HOWEVER, that being said, wings that look cool. 97 Mercury Sables came with a wedge style wing that would look good. But I'm with dannyboy, if I do a wing in the future I'll take a look at aluminum universal wings and anybody who calls me riceboy can kiss my pimply white a$$.||||reg||1
Z||000012||Philphine||06-12-2001||10:01 AM||||haven't messed with a gt body style yet but i have a couple of mustang wings on coupes (one i haven't put on yet). i like the combat style one someone adapted from an eclipse for their gt though.||||reg||1
Z||000013||Mr.Frosty||06-12-2001||10:19 AM||||I'm removing mine.I have the GT notchback style,and I plan to put one of those reverse mustang scoops on and I don't want the wing to take away from the scoop.I want the scoop to stand out more.So bye bye wing.I don't like the Gt wings anyhow.<P>------------------<BR>85 GT Turbo intercooled||||reg||12
Z||000014||fropuff||06-12-2001||10:47 AM||||Originally posted by stimpy:<BR>"Here's an option...DON'T DO IT!!!<BR>GT's do look a lot better with flat decks, in my opinion."<P>&gt;Well, that's the thing; I'm painting my ground effects red for the 88 GT monochromatic-esque look.  I think a wing will look good, but I can't find a pic of a red 88 GT without a wing.  So if there's one out there, please say so.  And I want to get the ground effects painted the same time as the wing.  Thanks!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>||||reg||1
Z||000015||fropuff||06-13-2001||05:08 PM||||I was wondering if anyone out there that has a GT wing would do me a favor.  I'm wondering the stock measurements of the GT wing, as I want to compare the dimensions to those of a Firebird wing.  Here's the ones for the third gen Firebird:<P>-60" wide<BR>-8" deep<BR>-1" high at front<BR>-2" high at rear<BR>-mounting stands are 39.5" apart.  <P>There's one on eBay for $20.  Thanks!!!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
