Z||000027||GT-maniac||06-16-2001||01:49 AM||||I have a firebird wing on my 85 GT, I think it looks great. It's a lot smaller than a stock fiero wing but a whole lot cheaper too.<BR>Plus it's made of aluminum so it's won't sag like some of the fiero wings do. It's held on with just two bolts which lined up perfectly in the stock hole locations which are predrilled into the decklid. Here's a pic, I can take a closer one tomorrow if your interested.<BR> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Fiero006_1.JPG"> <p>[This message has been edited by GT-maniac (edited 06-16-2001).]||||reg||1
